{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_004_03_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3bf446d55f40d76667707ee45a401d81d9c0b5d013098243151e938f373d4c18",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72de2aa0b9aa78ab37b4c0079baf8cb2c6a1305a82b769b6ad5ecb0d745d81fb",
      "text": "和隔壁镇的那帮人起冲突，\n结果被人家直接占领了镇子中央……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54133ef3e003ddda88e2f6de4c13566cb033d46f5253b7fc49618cc982717fb7",
      "text": "你们这群家伙，在搞什么名堂啊。\n我都说了多少次不要去招惹他们了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c3561c406d7d43bdbdabcefc61a0adb7c1e2e7f46ef597a9f6aa1e02a073c48",
      "text": "对、对不住！可是那些家伙，\n大模大样地把我们的地盘搅得一塌糊涂……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:502bd4d432d7db620dc1ad0a603030897c2b1d63e4ae98c82011a79030f1621e",
      "text": "本来只是想把他们赶走，\n结果我们的人被打了，一时……没忍住火……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e93a19e4970ccc66ecfb462acc154be3c4684e94058157cc37d1ee10a1ee59c7",
      "text": "那些家伙……叫我们把总长叫过去。\n但这种事，我们哪敢跟总长商量啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16c88f2ad40f6cb7cee009df8993b2e97c260f55bc3b0f97b4dd36c51494e4ff",
      "text": "于是他们就说，要是总长不行就叫副总长……\n把“茨城鬼神”叫出来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:804c6f5e8e0b68d9f9bf1d4189fc914c3f11f1dbb03edd7d555b742168762a8a",
      "text": "……真拿你们没办法。我知道了。\n叔叔，不好意思，我出去一趟！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c45c0eec08bf94fa9fe4e1cd40437ebf9c6c65995cc3c1ff89a30a8dc3e63a6f",
      "text": "噢……实，千万别受伤啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b7bd2906ac4cabdbbed5b4363072a199c3a1baf5d1ed2422dd60377ba687fab",
      "text": "哈哈，虽然每次你都这么说，但别强人所难啦。\n走吧，小的们！告诉我那帮混蛋在哪！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bec5a32ddd5029544719942f9f5734811e196fe5d4b11a21262af413c7f8bd63",
      "text": "是！在这边！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
